ect.mjs --work <dir> --frozen-at 2026-10-29 --seed refit-shopify-2026-10-29 --dev-from docs/benchmarks/2026-10-16-shopify-repos.json --dev-from docs/benchmarks/2026-10-16-shopify-fresh-repos.json",
